# Tuinvale Guide (a 2/3 flyer): "Celebration — This creature gets +1/+0 and has lifelink as long as two or more nonland
# permanents entered the battlefield under your control this turn." On turn 7 Bot1 plays its fourth Plains and casts the Guide:
# one nonland permanent (itself) and a land entered, so it is a plain 2/3 flyer. A Mox Pearl entering makes two: 3/3 with
# lifelink. On turn 9 nothing has entered this turn, so it is a 2/3 without lifelink again.

